  <h2 id="model-card-anthropic-claude-haiku-4-5-header"><span class="inlinemediaobject"><img src="/images/bedrock/latest/userguide/images/models/claude.png" class="aws-docs-img-whiteBg aws-docs-img-xs-padding" alt="Orange rounded square icon with white radial loading spinner design." data-alt-text-source="generated" height="30px" /> </span> Anthropic — Claude Haiku 4.5</h2>
  
  <h2 id="model-card-anthropic-claude-haiku-4-5-details">Model Details</h2>
  <p>Claude Haiku 4.5 is Anthropic's lightweight model optimized for speed and efficiency with strong coding and agent performance. For more information about model development and performance, see the <a href="https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/7aad69bf12627d42234e01ee7c36305dc2f6a970.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span>model/service card</span><awsui-icon class="awsdocs-link-icon" name="external"></awsui-icon></a>.</p>

  <div class="itemizedlist">
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
  <ul class="itemizedlist"><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Model launch date:</b> Oct 16, 2025</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>EOL no sooner than:</b> Oct 16, 2026</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Legacy period:</b> at least 6 months</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Model lifecycle policy:</b> <a href="./model-lifecycle-legacy.html">Model lifecycle (For Models Launched Prior to Sept 7 2026)</a></p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Model EOL date:</b> No sooner than 10/1/2026</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>End User License Agreements and Terms of Use:</b> <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/legal/bedrock/third-party-models/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span>View</span><awsui-icon class="awsdocs-link-icon" name="external"></awsui-icon></a></p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Model lifecycle:</b> Active</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Context window:</b> 200K tokens</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Max output tokens:</b> 64K</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Reasoning:</b> Supported</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Knowledge cutoff:</b> Feb 2025</p></li><li class="listitem" style="list-style-type: none"><p><b>Marketplace product ID:</b> <code class="code">prod-xdkflymybwmvi</code></p></li></ul></div>
  <div class="table-container"><div class="table-contents"><table id="w637aac11c10c34b4b7"><thead>
